> Jeremy Stoller (Resident Dramaturg at the Jewish Plays Project) is a freelance dramaturg and producer. He also serves as resident dramaturg for terraNOVA Collective's Groundbreakers writers group and literary consultant for Luna Stage. Founder, The Dramaturgy Open Office Hour Project. Past: general manager; THE GOLEM OF HAVANA workshop production @ La MaMa; literary manager, Two River Theater (2010-2013); dramaturgy/literary work with The Flea, Disney Theatrical Group, PlayPenn, 52nd Street Project, Target Margin, First[ Person] Arts Festival, George Street Playhouse. He received his BA from Drew University.
At Art Kibbutz Jeremy participated as a member of the Jewish Plays Project team rehearsing to present excerpts from And You Shall Be A Blessing, a play with music about Debbie Friedman. The play took place on June 11th at the 14th Street Y at 10 pm as part of the Tikkun Leil Shavuot event - with Shira Kline, Naomi[ Less], Sarah Sokolic, Michael Bradley[ Cohen], Deborah Yarchun, and Max Jared. More here.

=== Text #141 ===
> These Stunning and Innov[ative] Collection of New Builds are located in the vibrant new area of Lomas de Cabo Roig in the city of Orihuela Costa between[ Alic]ante, Murcia and Cartagena with access to two nearby airports.
The plot where these villas are being built is high above the sea level so you can see the coastline and admire the horizon where the blue of the Mediterranean fuses with the blue of the sky.
On the ground floor of the Villa you can have two bedrooms and one social bathroom or you can have one bedroom, one social bathroom and one bedroom with a bathroom en-suite. Which one adapts better to your family needs? Both options are included in the price of the Villa at no[ extra] cost.
When you climb the stairs you get to a magical space with one bedroom with a bathroom en-suite and a panoramic window, a walk-in closet, a solarium and three terraces.
The ceiling of the first floor can be converted into a solarium from where the views are just mesmerizing.
Panasonic Aerothermal A/C Climatization and Hot Water System gives you on average a 60%[ saving] off your electric Bill, all easily controlled from your mobile phone or tablet.
Outside the Swimming pool (5 x 3m) has its own Waterfall and underwater lights. There is one Porch and 4 Terraces and a car port.
These Villas have been cleverly designed to benefit from the Mediterranean style of outside living but also enjoy the comforts of climate control indoors all the while enjoying views to your garden and Swimming Pool area and Sea Views.

